// The multi-output PICKER page (decision 50; decision 51 once demoted it behind a native bench
// window, and decision 65 retired that route entirely - this is now the ONLY sneak+F selection
// surface). A vertical RECIPE LIST: one full-width card per available output category, appended
// from RpgStationPickerPage.build via RpgStationPickerTab.ui. Never auto-opened; opened only on
// sneak+F when a station's input matches recipes across multiple native categories.
//
// COMPACT PANEL (maintainer smoke fix): the panel previously rendered full-screen-tall because
// its sized/backgrounded content (#RpgStationPickerRoot, Width-only, no Height) WAS this
// document's directly-appended root - a page's document root force-stretches to fill the
// viewport regardless of its own Anchor (the same trap RpgStationSummary.ui's header comment
// documents for a HUD document's root). The fix mirrors the OFFICIAL first-party small-dialog
// pattern (PrefabEditorExitConfirm.ui / NameRespawnPointPage.ui, hytale-shared-source): wrap the
// real panel in the native $C.@PageOverlay (full-viewport dim, intentional) with
// LayoutMode: Middle, which CENTERS its child instead of stretching it - so a Width-only child
// hugs exactly its own content height (title/hint/however many tab rows are showing) rather than
// filling the screen.
//
// Document path + top-level ids are mod-namespaced (RpgStationPicker.ui / #RpgStationPicker*) so
// a co-installed mod's page cannot clobber this one on the client's flat namespace.

$C = "../Common.ui";
$F = "../Common/ZigFrames.ui";

@RpgStationPickerTitleStyle = (FontSize: 22, RenderBold: true, TextColor: #eef3fa, HorizontalAlignment: Center, VerticalAlignment: Center);
@RpgStationPickerHintStyle = (FontSize: 14, TextColor: #9fb0c4, HorizontalAlignment: Center, VerticalAlignment: Center, Wrap: true);

$C.@PageOverlay {
  LayoutMode: Middle;

  Group #RpgStationPickerRoot {
    Anchor: (Width: 640);

    $F.@ZigDecoratedFrame {
      @CloseButton = true;
      Anchor: (Width: 640);

      #Content {
        Label #RpgStationPickerTitle {
          Text: "";
          Anchor: (Height: 30, Width: 604);
          Style: @RpgStationPickerTitleStyle;
        }

        Label #RpgStationPickerHint {
          Text: "";
          Anchor: (Top: 4, Width: 604);
          Style: @RpgStationPickerHintStyle;
        }

        // The recipe list - one full-width card per output category, appended here from
        // RpgStationPickerPage#build via RpgStationPickerTab.ui. LayoutMode: Top stacks them
        // vertically (each card carries its own Anchor.Bottom gap), the same shape the first-party
        // recipe list uses (Pages/Inventory/RecipeCatalogueRecipeButton.ui). This was a wrapping
        // two-up strip of 170px cards before the 2026-07-29 smoke fix; full-width rows give a long
        // client-resolved item name and its cost line room to render on one line each.
        Group #RpgStationPickerTabs {
          Anchor: (Top: 16, Width: 604);
          LayoutMode: Top;
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
